      "content": "got it, thanks. one more thing—i was reading this forum post earlier where some guy was saying the sound is almost like it's \"screaming\" or something. it sounded kind of weird to read. does that sound itself actually tell you anything more specific about the engine, or is it just a byproduct of the pressure? like, is there a difference in the \"tone\" of the whistle that points to different issues?",
